# Intentionally empty.
#
# Laravel always tries to load an environment file, and this project has no
# src/backend/.env by design: configuration is injected as container
# environment variables (spec DEC-6). APP_ENV=testing in phpunit.xml makes
# Laravel look for this file first, which keeps test output free of a
# "failed to open .env" warning on every Feature test.
#
# Do not put values here. Test configuration belongs in phpunit.xml.
